B.bec=s(["There is no cure once an animal shows signs. Do not touch a suspect animal. Keep people and pets away and call your vet or the veterinary authorities.","If a person is bitten or scratched: wash the wound with soap and running water for 15 minutes, then go the same day to the nearest fever hospital or hospital for the rabies vaccine. Do not wait for symptoms.","If your pet is bitten by a stray or unknown animal, take it to the vet the same day, even if it is vaccinated."],t.s)
